# Generated pixel-art assets land here.
#
# Run `pnpm gen:office-assets` (requires PIXELLAB_API_KEY) to populate this
# directory with PNGs. The Phaser scene uses procedural fallbacks if files
# are missing, so the Office tab works either way.
#
# This .gitkeep file is the only thing committed; generated PNGs are
# intentionally NOT in git (regenerable, and would bloat the repo).
